window.products.push({"id":680159,"name":"Interactive Health HT-110 Human Touch Robotic Massage Chair, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41B2ETH0JDL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description HT-110 does what you tell it, from the ergonomic headrest to the rotating calf and foot massager. Our Human Touch Technology starts with a patented mechanism that works like \"wrists and arms\"; we added \"hands\" - massage rollers that move three-dimensionally on a straight track. The result is a Robotic Massage that feels remarkably human, replicating the techniques used by professional massage therapists. Rolling feels like the gentle hands of a massage therapist, pressing firmly one one side of your spine, then the other. Kneading feels like thumbs pressing firmly in a circular motion on both sides of the spine; this motion goes deeper, lifting and stretching the muscles to improve circulation. Compression (HTT exclusive) feels like the heels of a professional therapist's hands firmly pushing on muscles alongside your spine; this aids in improving mobility and posture. Percussion feels like fists or the edge of hands rapidly tapping on your back; this invigorating deep muscle therapy is popular in sports medicine. Discover the ultimate in Robotic Massage wrapped up in a stylish, superior quality exterior that is virtually maintenance free. Amazon.com The Interactive Health HT-110 Human Touch Robotic Massage Chair is member of the elite Interactive Health \"HT\" series of robotic massage chairs. From head to toe, the HT-110 does just what you tell it, giving you practically a full-body message on demand. From the ergonomic headrest to the rotating calf and foot massager, this chair has you covered. Powerful, rotating multi-speed foot massager. The calf and foot massager is manually deployed to give you exact muscle treatment. Convenient side pocket holds your chair's remote. The HT-110 delivers comfort and relaxation with two powerful massage sessions. View larger . How does the HT-110 do it? It's called \"Human Touch Technology,\" or HTT -- a sophisticated set of human-like mechanisms, designed and engineered by a team of scientists, researchers, and engineers, who know how important massage is to good health. Based on the treatments used by massage therapists, chiropractors, and physicians, HTT is one of the most advanced robotic massage systems ever devised. Inside every HT-110 are the \"hands\" of a trained massage therapist. HTT closely replicates the therapeutic techniques used by back and spinal care professionals and is the preferred technology of the American College of Chiropractic Orthopedists. The massage modes that the HT-110 employs are designed to follow the natural contour of your spine to give your back a complete treatment. With the HT-110, you customize each movement to your own preference and need. With a simple touch of the chair's wired remote, you can choose the mode of massage that you want -- rolling, kneading, percussion, or compression -- and the speed you desire for each mode. By manually positioning the rollers to the zone of the back you want to focus on, you can get a full or partial, pre-programmed 15-minute message at the level of intensity that you want. The Four Modes of Massage From the controls of the chair's conveniently placed wired remote, you can choose the \"mode\" of your massage. The \"rolling\" mode -- with options for three speeds -- is designed to give you the feel of a gentle massage by pressing firmly on one side of your spine and then the other. This mode is a tension reducer and works to prepare your back for deeper tissue work. The chair's \"kneading\" option, offered in two speeds, feels like thumbs pressing firmly in circular motion on both sides of the spine and is a great way to improve your back's circulation. With the two speeds of \"compression\" mode -- an HTT exclusive -- the chair gives you the feel of the heel of your therapists hands, firmly pushing on muscles alongside your spine -- movement that's designed to aid in improving your mobility and posture. And with the \"percussion\" mode, also offered in two speeds, you'll feel fists, or the edge of a pair of strong hands, rapidly tapping on your back muscles. This is a popular therapy in sports medicine, and is used to flex spinal joints and invigorate your entire back. So, regardless of your massage needs, the HT-110 is designed to help. Head-to-Toe Massage Therapy As if having the power at the tip of your fingertips to massage any part of your back wasn't enough, the HT-110 gives your calves and feet full treatment as well. A powerful, rotating multi-speed foot and calf massager feels like strong hands giving you a thorough, three-dimensional massage. The calf and foot massager is manually deployed, which means that you can massage the exact muscle areas that need it the most. Best of all, these outstanding, unparalleled features are wrapped up in a stylish, black leather match vinyl that will add a touch of sophistication to any decor. Virtually maintenance free, this chair will give you years of comfort and massage therapy. So, whether you want to just kick back and take advantage of the","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41B2ETH0JDL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Interactive Health","source_asin":"B000BDG80M","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-680159","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000BDG80M","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000BDG80M","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
