window.products.push({"id":680161,"name":"SOONHUA Personal Air Cooler Portable Mini Fan with USB Charging Super Quiet Humidifier Misting Fan for Office Home Desk Bedroom Dorm Fan Use","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bSHlTKRHL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"❤❤Compact And PortableMeasuring 151x150x171mm, compact size, lightweight and portable handle make it easy to carry around. Easy-to-access USB charging design, this air cooler can be widely used in offices, dormitories, living rooms, bedrooms, kitchens, camping, etc. ❤❤Simple To OperateJust add water to the water tank from the top opening, connect it to the USB power port and turn on the device, then relax and enjoy fresh and moist breath. 150ml water tank can last and provide you with about 8 hours of cooling wind. ❤❤Quiet Working & LED Night LightBuilt-in high-speed brushless motor delivers powerful wind but works at low noise to avoid disturbing your sleep. Besides air cooler, it can also serve as a soft night light to accompany you at night. CAUTION: When working as a night light, this device will not give out the wind. ❤❤Air PurificationWhile cooling down, our cooling fan also releases millions of negative ions to effectively purify the air, eliminate PM2.5, smoke, unpleasant odor, and other harmful substances in the air, to improve breathing and sleep quality, making sure your every breath is clean air. ❤❤Enjoy Cool Clean Air In Hot SummerThis USB personal air cooler has combined fan, humidifier, and cooler together, can be used as a fan at waterless mode, humidifier when adding natural water and fast cooling down when adding ice water. Your ideal partner in this hot summer spreads coolness naturally, and easily creates a personal cooling zone.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61bSHlTKRHL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOONHUA","source_asin":"B089GJHW8Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-680161","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089GJHW8Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089GJHW8Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":680162,"name":"Automatic Foam Soap Dispenser,5oz/150 ml Automatic Soap Dispenser Touchless,Waterproof Soap Dispenser,Suitable for Bathrooms,Kitchens,Offices,Hotels,S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yWB--W21L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✅【Capacity and Materials】 - Our Automatic Foam Soap Dispenser is made of high quality ABS thermoplastic, our hands-free foam soap dispenser is sturdy and durable, will not conduct electricity very safe, compared to those super large capacity, will leave excess liquid, 150ML/5OZ is The best choice of capacity, reasonable and light, to solve the trouble of excess liquid for you. ✅【Non-contact Soap Dispenser】 - Using infrared motion sensor design, just place your hand under the sensor, and the sensitive infrared sensor will automatically sense and emit rich and delicate soap (sensing distance: ≤5CM). Get full bubbles immediately. ✅【Quick Foaming】 - Compared with other manual automatic soap dispensers, our automatic hand sanitizer dispenser adopts the latest designed independent button, built-in precise infrared motion and PIR sensor detection technology. No contact, dense foam soap can be obtained in 0.25 seconds. ✅【Waterproof and Leakproof and Easy to Install】 - This non-contact soap dispenser is waterproof and leakproof, no need to worry about water leakage anymore, installation just insert 4 AAA batteries and liquid soap into the soap dispenser, turn on the button, wait for 0.1 seconds after the indicator light turns blue, put your hand Place it under the sensor and it will quickly pump out the foam. Save your time and keep your hands clean. ✅【Wide Range of Applications】 - This Automatic Foaming Soap Dispenser is suitable for portable use when you are studying at school or staying in a hotel, whether you are at home or school, bathroom, toilet, kitchen, restaurant, hotel or hospital can also be used every day. Kids also love using our fully automatic foaming hand sanitizer dispenser.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yWB--W21L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LagomLF","source_asin":"B0B31865SH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-680162","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B31865SH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B31865SH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
