window.products.push({"id":680326,"name":"Fully Assembled Cinco De Mayo Photo Booth Props. 30 Piece Box Set of Mexican Fiesta, Taco Party Decorations Kit. Colorful Selfie Party Supplies. Origi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716XKXBXu7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FULLY ASSEMBLED = NO WASTED TIME GLUING THEM TOGETHER 🌟 Your colorful Fiesta photo booth props will arrive to you in a sturdy box, already pre-assembled onto thick 9.5 inch wooden sticks. All you have to do is take them out of the box and you’re ready to go! We also include 30 glue dots that are optional to use in case you want to add even more support. We’ve seen many of our customers use the glue dots to add a few of the props to their walls as added party decor! FUN DESIGNS MAKE YOUR PARTY AND PHOTOS STAND OUT 🌟 We put a lot of thought into designing each photo prop ourselves to ensure that every sign was super cute and perfect for your Taco Party or Mexican Fiesta party. They work well in pictures (of course!), as centerpieces, or wall decor. STURDY CARDSTOCK AND STICKS WILL LAST ALL PARTY LONG 🌟 Our Cinco De Mayo props are made of 350 gsm card stock, which means they are thick. This high quality means they can hold up to being used all night long (plus they come packaged in a box that you can store them in to re-use for future parties if you'd like). The dowels we used are made of thick quality wood, so they won’t break or fray. SET OF 30 MEANS LOTS OF (CUTE) OPTIONS 🌟 Our large set of 30 props includes plenty of options for everyone to choose from. We didn’t just throw together a bunch of random props out there though. We made sure they all coordinated and included a good mix of sayings, cute hats and glasses, and fun signs/props unique to a Fiesta party! There are so many options that everyone will find plenty they want to use! PEACE OF MIND GUARANTEE 🌟 If for any reason you don't love your Fiesta themed photo booth props let us know and you'll get a replacement or your money back. It’s as simple as that!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716XKXBXu7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Perfect Occasion","source_asin":"B09ZX6W82P","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-680326","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZX6W82P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZX6W82P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
