window.products.push({"id":680593,"name":"21 Inch Statue of Liberty Replica Statue New York City Edition","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JSCerddsL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","description":"21 inch authentic replica of the Statue of Liberty. New York Wonder of the World and American icon. This extraordinary piece is proudly crafted in a New York City workshop. The 21 inch tall scaled replica of the Statue of Liberty is meticulously sculpted and hand painted patina. The Statue of Liberty, designed by sculptor Frédéric Auguste Bartholdi, was given by the French government to the United States as a token of friendship between the two countries and dedicated by President Grover Cleveland on October 28, 1886. In the 1870s, Bartholdi began making small-scale replicas to help pay for the real one. By the time of official dedication.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41JSCerddsL._AC_SL1010_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"City-Souvenirs","source_asin":"B09KYHV7MW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-680593","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KYHV7MW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KYHV7MW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":680594,"name":"Ataller Electric Wine Stopper, Automatic Vacuum Wine Saver, Electric Smart Wine Stopper, Reusable Bottle Sealer & Wine Preservation System - Wine Acce","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yjuTo336L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ataller Wine Stoppers, it is widely used for the preservation of red wine, white wines and champagnes, as well as the preservation of bottles of the same radius. Notice: The product does not come with batteries, you need to buy 2 pieces of AAA batteries by yourself. Automatic Repeated Detection The electronic wine stopper will automatically detect the air pressure in the red wine bottle. When the pressure in the bottle exceeds -0.01 Mpa, it will automatically perform repeated vacuuming to ensure that the vacuum state is reached at any time and truly achieve the effect of efficient freshness . Use Suggestions: Step 1: Press the wine stopper down to the rubber part of the bottle mouth. The wine stopper will start to work automatically when it is pressed into the bottle. Step 2: The blue stopper displays a blue breathing light during normal operation. When the vacuum inside the bottle is exhausted, the blue light turns on after 5 seconds. Step 3: During the storage process, the wine stopper will automatically detect the air pressure in the bottle. When the negative air pressure exceeds -0.01 Mpa, it can be automatically evacuated multiple times. Step 4: When the bottle tilts to 45 degrees while the wine stopper is working, the anti-fall function is triggered and stops working, the red indicator light flashes. And when the bottle is less than 45 degrees, the wine stopper will start working again. Packing List: *1 Electric vacuum wine stopper *1 Manual *1 English box Product Specifications: Net weight: 97±5g Product size: 71*48.5*71 mm Packing size: 80*51*80 mm","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61yjuTo336L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ataller","source_asin":"B08H84YC28","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-680594","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08H84YC28","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08H84YC28","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
