window.products.push({"id":680735,"name":"(Monogrammed F) Vintage Double Infinity Symbol Wedding Monogram Gift Inspired - Laser Engraved 12.75oz Libbey All-Purpose Wine Taster Glass","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lIWSg6vAL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","description":"Elegant and Beautiful. The Libbey Vina 8552 Wine Taster Glass is sure to impress! Perfect for any occasion, this glass is the perfect balance between sophistication and style.Coming in at just a little over 7 ½ inches tall and holding 12 ¾ ounces of liquid, this little companion is an excellent match for red or white wine lovers.Not only for drinking but decoration as well, our quality laser etching process ensures a superior etch that is practical and dishwasher safe. Make no mistake! 100% satisfaction guaranteed or your money back!Whether you are buying as a gift or for yourself, we want to welcome you in supporting the American Dream by offering you our very best.Quality, value, and pride go into every glass to ensure the best possible experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51lIWSg6vAL._AC_SL1250_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Appalachia Design Company","source_asin":"B018WGOCOI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-680735","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B018WGOCOI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B018WGOCOI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":680736,"name":"Leggett & Platt Fremont Metal SNAP Bed with Folding Frame Bedding Support System and Rounded Edge Panels, Weathered Nickel Finish, King","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oS93OXAtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Fremont SNAP™ Bed solves the problem of having to sacrifice fashion and style in the bedroom due to difficult assembly, oversized components or costly expenses. This transitional style bed has rounded edges that frame clean, straight lines throughout the 48-inch headboard and 19-inch footboard. Constructed of carbon steel for strength and stability, the frame has a brushed silver, Weathered Nickel finish with castings to provide extra detail in this bed design. This fashion forward bed is not only contemporary with its folding frame, built-in bedding support system, all-in-one-box design, but compact enough for standard shipping methods and retail store “carry-out” portability. The narrow SNAP™ Bed box is easy to maneuver through small hallways and staircases and includes everything included to make assembly a breeze. The easy-to-assemble steps can be summed up to 1) Assemble the headboard posts and pillow bar. 2) Unfold the side rails and snap them into the headboard and footboard. 3) Tighten the six (6) support legs into the slats. 4) Snap the slats into the side rails. Within minutes you’ll be ready to enjoy your new stylish bed. A box spring is required for this bed. This unit includes a headboard, footboard, folding side rails, bed support system, Allen wrench and minimal hardware for quick and easy assembly. The Leggett & Platt Fremont SNAP™ Bed comes with a 1-year limited warranty against manufacturing defects. Leggett & Platt Inc. is an industry leader in the production of adjustable bases, fashionable beds, bedding support, and top of bed textiles. By keeping a close eye on the design community and other fashion and decorating sources, Leggett & Platt stays on top of the trends and knows the right mix of finishes, innovative designs, and technology to continually provide quality crafted products at an exceptional value. Leggett & Platt Consumer Products: Value Without Compromise","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71oS93OXAtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Fashion Bed Group","source_asin":"B01AAYUXMK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-680736","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01AAYUXMK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01AAYUXMK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
