window.products.push({"id":680966,"name":"Designstyles Decorative Acrylic Easel Stand – Adjustable Floor Display for Art Pieces, Signs, Mirrors and Chalk/Dry Erase Boards – 58” Tall, Solid Cle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QVAjlO+uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Finding the perfect display is easier than you think. The Floor Easel by Designstyles is perfect for showcasing just about any vertical or horizontal wall hanging piece. With this display holder you don’t have to worry about hammering nails into the wall. Position it just about anywhere in the room and present anything from artwork to mirrors. An antique finished iron adds a touch of timeless style to any room. It’s ready to position so you show off artwork, signs, mirrors, framed photos, chalkboards and so much more. PRODUCT FEATURES: Acrylic Material Clear Color Dimensions: 58\" H x 22” W x 15/22/29/36” D Height Adjustable Hooks Great in Living Room, Bedroom, Studio, Café, and Restaurants No Tools Required Sturdy Floor Standing Display MULTIPURPOSE DISPLAY DÉCOR This versatile floor easel gives you the freedom to showcase a wide range of things in and out of your home. Add it to a room and instantly transform your home style. It can be used to display anything from artwork to picture frames. It’s great for both work and home! It makes the perfect sign holder and can easily hold a chalkboard. It’s a great way to promote your business for cafes or restaurants. It’s also great for parties, events or showcases. Set up the perfect signage in banquet halls. ABOUT US At Designstyles we believe organization and style should be effortless and affordable. So we work to provide a wide range of supplies and organizers that make life run smoothly. With everything from magazine racks to storage baskets, you can depend on our carefully crafted products to keep your home or office neat and clean. We’ve got everything you need to make things run smoothly in your home or office. Choose style and choose Designstyles!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61QVAjlO+uL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Designstyles","source_asin":"B07QKNV5BW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-680966","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QKNV5BW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QKNV5BW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
