window.products.push({"id":680973,"name":"Potato Masher - Stainless Steel Heavy Duty Masher with Long Handle, Collapsible Design - Kitchen Tool by Meaartem (Silver)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ahzgNN5yL._AC_.jpg","description":"✅MASHING MADE EASIER -- As against ordinary potato masher with a flat head, our heavy duty potato masher is designed with an curve-shaped mashing head.This unique design not only saves your strength but also allows the mashing head to reach corner of the bowel until mashed potato result in an fluffy consistency. ✅FOLD OR UNFOLD IT -- Press both sides of the stainless steel potato masher to fold or unfold it very easily.Collapsible easy-lock system to fix the head firmly for mashing. Unfold it with a press for convenient storage. ✅COMFORTABLE GRIP -- Large and round handle fit ergonomically into your hand to make your mashing experience super comfortable,not matter if you are creating creamy mashed potatoes, guacamole, avocado salad, salsa, puree or else with this masher kitchen tool. ✅MADE TO LAST -- Designed with a bent-proof construction, each part compactly connected with the other. Such a solid potato masher comes out as we constantly fix bugs and upgrade our kitchen tools from last generations. ✅100% RISK-FREE SATISFACTION GUARANTEE -- Contact us if you are not satisfied with our potato masher. All issues will be solved within 24 hours！","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ahzgNN5yL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"meaartem","source_asin":"B08HHQD2XV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-680973","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HHQD2XV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HHQD2XV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":680974,"name":"The Royal Gift Shop: Blue Genuine Brazilian Extra Quality Agate Bookends - Home Decor (Blue, 6-9 lbs)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91J2C9VFOaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"BRAZILIAN AGATE GEODES are sliced and polished to create natural bookends that show off the beauty of both the rough and polished stone. These bookends have two polished sides for each piece and a smooth cut base. Agate is excellent for balancing emotional and physical energy. Historically, it has been used in healing amulets and ornamentation dating back to Babylon. 'Agate' is the name given to numerous varieties of banded Chalcedony, a mineral of the quartz family. Usually banded in layers or stripes, some varieties have specks of color or fossilized inclusions, while others are solid. Dubbed a 'earth rainbow', the concentric bands of Agate form in nearly every color the earth can produce, including a colorless shade. SOME WIDELY ACCLAIMED BENEFITS OF AGATE: Promotes inner stability, composure, and maturity  Its warm, protective properties encourage security and self-confidence It is a great crystal to use during pregnancy, and also helps new mothers avoid the 'baby Blues' sometimes experienced after giving birth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91J2C9VFOaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Royal Gift Shop","source_asin":"B01LZS4GTV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-680974","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LZS4GTV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LZS4GTV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
