window.products.push({"id":681001,"name":"Jacuzzi J-LX/J-LXL Pillow, 2011+","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BObCYIbTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Refresh and refurbish your backyard oasis by replacing your pillows every few years. These factory-original, genuine Jacuzzi parts are identical to the pillows that come with every new J-LX series hot tub. You’ll enjoy genuine Jacuzzi quality while restoring the premium look and feel of your J-LX or J-LXL spa. Each pillow has two permanent plastic bolts or “nipples” that secure the pillow to a mount in your Jacuzzi J-LX hot tub. These bolts are 7” (18cm) apart, measuring center-to-center. Your J-LX series tub was designed to make a visual statement. The pillows are one of the most visible elements of your deluxe model Jacuzzi hot tub, so faded, cracked, or missing pillows will detract from the sense of elegance and comfort of your tub. Replacing your hot tub pillows when they become stained, faded, or stiff for a low-cost way to restore your tub to its original beauty and comfort. As of November 2020, these pillows are compatible with the following Jacuzzi hot tub models Jacuzzi J-LX 2011–19 Jacuzzi J-LX 2011–19 Jacuzzi J-LXL 2011–19 Jacuzzi J-LXL 2011–19 No other Jacuzzi hot tubs can use these pillows. Please do not attempt to modify or jury-rig 6455-485 pillows to fit some other spa No other Jacuzzi hot tubs can use these pillows. Please do not attempt to modify or jury-rig 6455-485 pillows to fit some other spa Hot tub pillows are designed for the elements: water, sun, winter’s cold, and summer’s heat. Eventually, however, the soft rubber can stiffen and the waterproof surface can crack, allowing water inside the foam and speeding deterioration. Hair products, harsh spa care products, and strong UV rays from the sun can dull or discolor the pillows over time. These genuine Jacuzzi parts are soft, comfortable, and perfectly compatible with the look and feel of your J-LX series spa. No special tools are required to replace your existing pillows with these Jacuzzi-brand replacements. To avoid accidental damage to the soft rubber, we recommend you avoid using sharp metal tools. Often, a plastic ruler, wooden paint stirrer, plastic kitchen spatula, or similar comm","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BObCYIbTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Jacuzzi","source_asin":"B00GZYSWJQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-681001","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00GZYSWJQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00GZYSWJQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
